  m_Text: "<b>[QU\u1EA2N L\xDD IDOL]:</b>\n'T\u1ED1i nay nh\u1EDB l\xEAn s\xF3ng \u0111\xFAng 19:30 nh\xE9 em. Nh\u1EDB ki\u1EC3m tra micro v\xE0 g\xF3c camera!'\n\n<b>[TR\u01AF\u1EDENG FANCLUB]:</b>\n'T\u1EE5i em \u0111\xE3 chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB hashtag trending \u0111\u1EA9y top cho anh r\u1ED3i \u1EA1! Ch\xFAc idol live b\xF9ng n\u1ED5!'\n\n<b>[NH\xC3N H\xC0NG GAMING]:</b>\n'Nh\xE3n h\xE0ng g\u1EEDi t\u1EB7ng set tai nghe m\u1EDBi, ch\xFAc m\u1EEBng bu\u1ED5i stream th\xE0nh c\xF4ng!'"
